    "title": "Four Killed, Six Injured In Car Crash Near Nashik Toll Plaza | India News - News18",
    "text": "A serious road accident took place near Chachadgaon Toll Plaza on the Nashik–Peth road in Maharashtra’s Nashik district. The collision involved an Ertiga car and a Scorpio SUV and occurred on Wednesday. Four people lost their lives in the crash. Six others were injured and were rushed to a nearby hospital for treatment. The condition of the injured was not immediately known. Emergency teams reached the spot soon after the accident. Rescue operations are still underway to clear the damaged vehicles and assist those affected.",
